              "text": "kraulen — \"to swim front crawl\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mein Sohn kann schon kraulen. My son can already swim front crawl."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A different verb kraulen means to scratch gently: den Hund hinter den Ohren kraulen."
            }
          ]
