          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The swimming verb kraulen was borrowed from English crawl; the other kraulen, \"to scratch gently\", comes from krauen (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
